{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます＼^^／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん！とまと！\n誕生日おめでとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん知ってました？\n二人とも中田と同い年なのですよ！\n見えない！！！！\nコンベンションの\n可愛すぎるプリキュアを見て\n発狂したよ、私←\nいっつも可愛いくてゆるい二人が\n大好きだよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/lovely.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( ゜_ゝ゜)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手紙とコメントと会いに行くので\nどれが一番嬉しい？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n全部嬉しい！！！\nけど私は会ってお話するのが\n一番好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな髪色は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n自分においては染めた事が\n一度もないので\n染めてみたい気もあります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/bud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何色がいいですか？＼^^／ｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「中田花奈の良さを広めようの会」について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたら入れる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中田花奈の良さを広めよう\nという気持ちをお持ちの皆さまは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すでに会員です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入会特典は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中田花奈からの愛"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入会金は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中田花奈の良さを広めよう\nという気持ち！\nプライスレス！(ｃ)←"